# React Bits (free)

Use the **free** React Bits stack from [DavidHDev/react-bits](https://github.com/DavidHDev/react-bits). Do **not** require React Bits Pro or `REACTBITS_LICENSE_KEY` unless the user explicitly opts in.

## MCP server

Configured in `.cursor/mcp.json`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "reactbits": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "reactbits-dev-mcp-server"],
      "env": {
        "GITHUB_TOKEN": "your_github_token_here"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Replace `your_github_token_here` with a GitHub PAT (repo read is enough). Without a token the server still works but is limited to ~60 GitHub API requests/hour.

After editing MCP config, restart Cursor or reload MCP servers.

## shadcn registry (install into renderer)

`components.json` includes the free registry:

```json
"registries": {
  "@react-bits": "https://reactbits.dev/r/{name}.json"
}
```

Install from the renderer directory (uses `renderer/components.json`), e.g.:

```bash
cd renderer && npx shadcn@latest add @react-bits/Orb-TS-TW
```

Prefer `@react-bits/*` over `@reactbits-starter/*` (Pro). **`ai-blob-tw` is Pro-only**; voice UI uses free **`Orb`** instead.

## Voice UI blob

`renderer/src/components/AiBlob/AiBlob.tsx` wraps `@/components/Orb/Orb` (React Bits free WebGL orb). Map recording/processing to `forceHoverState` + `hoverIntensity`.
